    "founders_heads": "The minds behind Aventura",
    "founders_first_text": "We are Nico and Altay, two young computer science students from Germany who have always enjoyed traveling and now want to offer others a platform that is ideal for travel. Aventura provides various tools and options to book trips and consider every single step and piece of information for traveling to a specific country. Our focus is on countries and regions that are not yet considered major tourist destinations but still offer almost undiscovered beauty.",
    "founders_second_text": "The pictures show us on our own travels: the first was taken in a bar in Istanbul, the second on the Areopagus in Greece, where the Apostle Paul preached the Gospel to the Greeks. More trips are already planned!",
    "founders_third_text": "You too should not spend your life only in your own country and region; while traveling, you discover beautiful new places, cultures, and come into contact with people whose lives and mentalities differ slightly or even fundamentally from ours. Book your next trip via our portal now, expand your horizons, and increase your joy in life!",
    
